WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.237 --> 00:00:02.025
- Someone has to water the plants.

00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:03.575
Water the plants.

00:00:06.878 --> 00:00:08.503
- So, a year ago, when I was an intern,

00:00:08.503 --> 00:00:12.368
my old boss Cody was religious
about us watering the plants.

00:00:13.727 --> 00:00:16.367
- He's very organized, always
prepared for every job,

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:18.433
and just constantly on top of everything.

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:19.943
- I created an Excel spreadsheet.

00:00:19.943 --> 00:00:22.330
He would come in on weekends
and water the plants himself,

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:25.213
and actually put his name
on the Excel spreadsheet.

00:00:25.213 --> 00:00:26.467
- If we didn't water the plants,

00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:28.209
he would, like, message us individually,

00:00:28.209 --> 00:00:30.275
being like, hey did you water the plants?

00:00:30.275 --> 00:00:32.504
I definitely feared my job a few times.

00:00:32.504 --> 00:00:34.013
- Now that I'm no longer an intern,

00:00:34.013 --> 00:00:35.569
it's time to get him back.

00:00:35.569 --> 00:00:38.262
So, we bought the exact same dead plants,

00:00:38.262 --> 00:00:40.259
and swapped them out with the live ones.

00:00:40.259 --> 00:00:42.651
The intern Ricky has taken
over watering the plants

00:00:42.651 --> 00:00:43.998
for the last two months,

00:00:43.998 --> 00:00:46.946
and he has no idea what's about to happen.

00:00:46.946 --> 00:00:50.220
We set up hidden cameras
pretending to film other videos,

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.217
and mic'd up all the desks.

00:00:52.217 --> 00:00:54.400
I've been dreaming about
pulling this prank on Cody

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.295
for the past six months.

00:00:58.695 --> 00:01:01.180
So, we just swapped out the
live plants for the dead ones,

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:03.641
and we got Laina, head
of the art department,

00:01:03.641 --> 00:01:05.289
to go in, and let Cody know,

00:01:05.289 --> 00:01:07.095
that his plants are dying.

00:01:07.170 --> 00:01:08.679
- I was looking at these guys out here,

00:01:08.679 --> 00:01:09.678
and they kind of,

00:01:09.678 --> 00:01:11.048
they look like they haven't
been watered in awhile,

00:01:11.048 --> 00:01:13.573
so I was just like, let me check with you.

00:01:14.384 --> 00:01:17.704
- According to the log here,
Ricky's watering the plants.

00:01:17.704 --> 00:01:19.005
Ricky.

00:01:20.625 --> 00:01:21.794
Plants, man.

00:01:21.794 --> 00:01:23.089
Have they not been watered?

00:01:29.038 --> 00:01:31.824
- I mean, they look pretty, pretty bad.

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:33.328
I don't know.

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:35.493
- I just watered them this morning, dude.

00:01:39.391 --> 00:01:41.526
- They were green, and now they're all,

00:01:41.526 --> 00:01:44.127
all the plants are brown.

00:01:44.127 --> 00:01:45.632
Like the whole plant is brown.

00:01:45.632 --> 00:01:46.886
- Well, when did you water them last?

00:01:46.886 --> 00:01:47.838
- This morning!

00:01:47.838 --> 00:01:49.115
- As per the little schedule

00:01:49.115 --> 00:01:51.530
we got Ricky the past three days.

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:53.034
(all clamoring)

00:01:59.378 --> 00:02:00.905
- Look here, look.

00:02:04.184 --> 00:02:05.902
- So, Ricky just walked outside,

00:02:05.902 --> 00:02:07.876
and is looking at the alive plants,

00:02:07.876 --> 00:02:10.982
and is super confused at what is going on.

00:02:15.585 --> 00:02:16.495
- Find him?

00:02:18.092 --> 00:02:19.062
- Our plants?

00:02:20.119 --> 00:02:21.228
- They're dead?

00:02:23.235 --> 00:02:24.013
- What?

00:02:24.013 --> 00:02:24.752
- I don't understand.

00:02:24.752 --> 00:02:26.331
- What plants are outside right now?

00:02:26.331 --> 00:02:28.839
Where are the three of
ours that have been alive?

00:02:28.839 --> 00:02:30.134
(all talking)

00:02:30.134 --> 00:02:31.217
Where are the dead ones?

00:02:31.919 --> 00:02:33.353
The dead ones are gone.

00:02:36.075 --> 00:02:37.765
- [Voiceover] Something
weird is happening.

00:02:38.049 --> 00:02:40.366
- There are three
healthy plants out there.

00:02:41.207 --> 00:02:42.832
And the three that we saw two minutes ago

00:02:42.832 --> 00:02:44.081
are somewhere else.

00:02:50.332 --> 00:02:52.538
- Okay, Cody does not
appear to be coming outside

00:02:52.538 --> 00:02:54.210
a third time to see the dead plants.

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:57.530
So, we just sent Andrew,
the head of the department,

00:02:57.530 --> 00:02:59.572
to go up to him and say something.

00:03:00.943 --> 00:03:02.917
- Hey, dude, have you seen the plants?

00:03:07.237 --> 00:03:08.596
These are totally brown.

00:03:15.869 --> 00:03:17.396
- Cody, your interns are asleep.

00:03:20.625 --> 00:03:22.225
- I don't even know what's
happening right now.

00:03:22.672 --> 00:03:24.779
- Alright, time to go tell him.

00:03:29.103 --> 00:03:31.257
(all laughing and talking)

00:03:31.634 --> 00:03:33.231
- Is all this gear for this right now?

00:03:48.282 --> 00:03:49.397
- [Voiceover] So, this is all a joke.

00:03:49.397 --> 00:03:50.720
- This has all been a joke.

00:03:50.720 --> 00:03:52.178
(laughter)

00:03:52.624 --> 00:03:55.736
- So, I'm super happy with
the way the prank turned out.

00:03:55.736 --> 00:03:57.222
Ironically, I think this ended up

00:03:57.222 --> 00:03:59.358
being more of a prank on Ricky.

00:03:59.358 --> 00:04:01.239
- Thought my head was gonna explode.

00:04:01.239 --> 00:04:03.514
They kept on flipping, it was insane.

00:04:03.514 --> 00:04:06.138
My brain really has like a flip in it.

00:04:06.138 --> 00:04:08.251
I was like, I need to see a neurologist.

00:04:08.251 --> 00:04:10.085
- But, I still pranked Cody.

00:04:10.085 --> 00:04:11.548
That was my goal in the end.

00:04:11.548 --> 00:04:12.477
- Very elaborate.

00:04:12.477 --> 00:04:13.545
But, nice work.

00:04:13.545 --> 00:04:14.825
You guys pulled it off.

00:04:18.026 --> 00:04:20.301
- [Voiceover] Why do you feel
like they need to stay alive?

00:04:21.651 --> 00:04:22.850
(laughter)

00:04:23.784 --> 00:04:25.224
- Can't believe this.

00:04:25.224 --> 00:04:26.960
Monsters, that I work with.

